<title>INDIA: India HDFC Bank cuts prime lending rate.</title>
<headline>India HDFC Bank cuts prime lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's private HDFC Bank Ltd will cut its prime lending rate (PLR) to 15.25 percent per annum effective August 1, 1997, a bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new rate is exclusive of interest tax.</p>
<p>The bank's current PLR is 16.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
